        "WP-005 implementation complete. UpdateReferenceWithConfirmationAsync() in DiffDialogViewModel.cs now builds a risk-specific confirmation message using ConfirmUpdateMessage_RiskyChanges with embedded singular/plural detail lines for removed and inserted mod counts. Safe-only paths (added/replaced) continue to bypass the dialog. Build: 0 errors, 0 warnings. 492/494 tests pass; 2 are pre-existing intentionally skipped stubs. The 2 confirmation dialog test stubs (ConfirmationMessage_RiskyChanges_IncludesRemovedCount, ConfirmationMessage_SafeChanges_SkipsDialog) remain skipped due to the documented test-constructor barrier — this is a known pre-existing limitation, not a regression."
